2073 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Cola Munchies is a website dedicated to satisfying your cravings and curiosity\056 My interest in food blogging stemmed from my parents\031 love language in food\056 They are the ones that taught me the importance of food not just for nutrition but as a way to bond with family and friends\056\n\nI am originally from Myrtle Beach\054 SC and now I attend the University of South Carolina\054 I realized I miss a lot of foods from home\056 I was used to my parents cooking Filipino food all the time but now I am mainly cook on my own\056 However\054 I am very open to trying new foods in Columbia because of my love for cultures\056\n\nWe are dedicated to exploring various cuisines\054 finding local sit\055down restaurants\054 quick bites\054 and overall food events\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 2074 0 R
