2155 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tacos Locos nails that perfect blend of lively energy and laid\021back comfort\054 making it a spot you actually want to hang around in\056 The warm lighting and colorful d\351cor give the place a fun\054 welcoming vibe that fits the name\056 Their al pastor tacos are the standout\024juicy\054 perfectly seasoned\054 and balanced with just the right touch of sweetness from the pineapple\056 The carne asada tacos hit just as hard\054 packed with smoky flavor and tender cuts that feel way above \034local joint\035 expectations\056 Altogether\054 it\031s the kind of restaurant that turns a quick taco stop into a full\055on favorite\056)
     /K [ 53 ]
     /P 2156 0 R
     /Pg 2049 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

