2163 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Inakaya delivers the kind of atmosphere that feels almost transported straight from a quiet Tokyo side street\024soft lantern lighting\054 the gentle clatter of chopsticks\054 and a calm\054 intimate vibe that makes every seat feel like the best one in the house\056 The sushi is unbelievably fresh\054 with each piece crafted so precisely that you can taste the care in every bite\056 Their ramen is just as impressive\054 with a broth that\031s rich\054 layered\054 and comforting without ever feeling heavy\056 Together\054 the dishes make Inakaya feel less like a restaurant and more like a small cultural escape\056 It\031s the kind of place you walk out of already planning your next visit\056)
     /K [ 57 ]
     /P 2164 0 R
     /Pg 2049 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

