  << /ActualText (Inakaya felt completely different from any place I\031ve eaten before\054 almost like stepping into a quiet corner of Tokyo with lanterns glowing and soft chatter in the background\056 Since it was my first time at a sushi bar\054 I was honestly surprised by how fresh and clean every bite of sushi tasted\056 The ramen was just as memorable\054 with a broth so rich and comforting it made me rethink what ramen is supposed to be\056 Walking out\054 I already knew I\031d be coming back\056)
